	(text "POWER: Eurorack +12V / -12V -> B5819W per rail -> +12V / -12V (about +/-11.6 V).\n+5V and pins 11-16 unused. 100n at every op-amp supply pin, 10u bulk per rail.\n+12V -> U501 HT7533-1 -> +3V3 for the CV op amps Un02 and clamps only; audio stays on +/-12 V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 299.72 86.36 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "1f06c112-2b38-5123-aa43-eed7ecfe2d16")
	)
	(text "MIX (modules/imix): CHO n -> 100k -> SUM -> summer (100k || 20p) ->\ninverter -> 1k (2512) -> MIX. MIX = CHO1 + CHO2 + CHO3 with the input polarity.\nAll outputs 1k / 1 W 2512."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 309.88 110.49 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "2f456f6f-2249-501f-9cc4-5f6f21028eec")
	)
	(text "CHANNEL n (n = 1..3; refs Rn01..Rn14, Cn01..Cn08, Dn01, Un01..Un04, RVn VOL, RV(n+3) RANGE):\nevery input buffered at a fixed 100k.\nIN -> -1 buffer -> LDR + 10k -> -1 VCA stage (gain 10k / (10k + R_LDR)) -> 100R -> VOL n ->\nfollower -> 1k -> OUT n, and 100k -> SUM (OUT is post-volume).\nCV 0..5 V -> 51k / 100k (0..3.3 V, BAT54SW clamp) -> MCP6002 follower -> 1M / 1M (CV / 2)\n-> MCP6002 driver, LED in the loop, sense = 330R + RANGE: the modules/acid pipeline on +3V3.\nI_LED = CV x 0.331 / R_sense, linear from 0 V. RANGE at 0: 330R (~1 mA/V, ~4.5 mA max);\nRANGE at max: 330R + 50k || 10k = 8.66k (0.038 mA/V, 0.19 mA at 5 V).\nNo CV plug: TN normals CV to +12V via 200k (full scale, VCA open)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 299.72 203.2 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "aac36d5e-ec3a-594a-a9e9-7391736edeff")
	)
	(text "PWR_FLAG: #FLG01 marks the Eurorack GND; #FLG02/#FLG03 mark the +12V/-12V rails,\nfed from the header only through D501/D502, which ERC cannot see through."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 299.72 99.06 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "d19e909b-9ba5-53b8-baa3-863f373d50a4")
	)
	(text "BIG MODULAR VCA-MIX - S6 schematic: 3 x vactrol VCA (Bread Modular V2CA with its CURVE pot as RANGE, modules/acid 3.3 V CV pipeline) + post-VCA volume + 3-channel mixer (modules/imix). Circuit intent: docs/research.md"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 17.78 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "e15b0072-4805-5885-a20e-2f3ef9876a84")
	)
